**完整示例（可直接查看、可比对）**：
```json
{
  "page_id": "ep01-p1",
  "geo_lock": "assets/demo/maps/ep01-topdown.png",
  "panels": [
    {"panel": 1, "script_shot": "S01", "subject": "角色A", "walk_lock": "门口→桌前"}
  ],
  "page_status": "候选"
}
```
**可复用模板（占位符版，供执行期复制）**：
```json
{
  "page_id": "<PLACEHOLDER>",
  "geo_lock": "<PLACEHOLDER>",
  "panels": [
    {"panel": "<PLACEHOLDER>", "script_shot": "<PLACEHOLDER>", "subject": "<PLACEHOLDER>", "walk_lock": "<PLACEHOLDER>"}
  ],
  "page_status": "<PLACEHOLDER>"
}
```
填写纪律：① 示例与模板的字段集/层级必须一致；② 示例必须自包含可查看（JSON 须合法可解析、表格须有表头+≥1 行数据）；③ 无格式交付物时显式写 `none-justified（理由）`，禁留空；④ 示例的 `vc_refs` 至少映射 1 个已存在 VC（Rule 113.4）。
